ht take longer than expected to finish the whole statue. Well, that's not a problem now, thanks to you!","nextNodeIds":[722140406]},{"nodeId":722140406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1487176682,"text":"I mean, I am being employed by a... cat, sure, but one should always avoid asking for extensions.","nextNodeIds":[722140407]},{"nodeId":722140407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":2249371690,"text":"Whatever the case, I'll get this one done as soon as I can... Come to think of it, the Lady Priestess said that once the statue is completed, something good will happen.","nextNodeIds":[722140408]},{"nodeId":722140408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3148667714,"text":"I'm not sure what that means exactly, but well... I'm quite looking forward to it, actually.","nextNodeIds":[722140409]},{"nodeId":722140409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":379804298,"text":"Come back in a while and have a look at the final product.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7221404,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INIT_TIME_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7221401,7221402,7221403,7221404],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":